OL,3,ATrekkers helicoptered off mountains as
OL,4,Amore deadly landslides hit Nepal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother wave of landslides and heavy
OL,7,Frain has killed about 30 people in
OL,8,FNepal, as the Himalayan nation reels
OL,9,Ffrom August's catastrophic flooding
OL,10,Fthat left 1,400 dead and thousands more
OL,11,Fmissing.
OL,13,FThe national disaster management
OL,14,Fauthority says more than 1,900 families
OL,15,Fhave been affected since late last week
OL,16,Fwith more than 240 homes damaged.
OL,17,FRoads, buildings and bridges have been
OL,18,Fswept away.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
