OL,3,ATrekkers helicoptered off mountains as
OL,4,Amore deadly landslides hit Nepal
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of trekkers on the Annapurna
OL,7,FCircuit - crucial to Nepal's economy -
OL,8,Fhave had to cut short their hikes to
OL,9,Fget to safety.
OL,11,FMany have been helicoptered out of the
OL,12,Fdistricts of Manang and Mustang, from a
OL,13,Fhiking circuit that usually takes up to
OL,14,Fthree weeks to complete.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
